  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 6802.02 Manufacturer Responsibility",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 6802.02 Manufacturer Responsibility.\n\n(a) A manufacturer of preliminary breath test devices may submit a request for an evaluation of the device by the laboratory.\n\n(b) Each device submitted for evaluation shall be accompanied by any peripheral materials necessary to perform the evaluation such as:\n\n(1) An operation manual;\n\n(2) A list of unit capabilities that include criteria identified in Saf-C 6802.03 (b);\n\n(3) The carrying case;\n\n(4) Mouthpieces;\n\n(5) Batteries; and\n\n(6) Peripheral hardware and software.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at Chapter Heading for Saf-C 6800) #9685, eff 3-23-10; ss by #12518, eff 4-23-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c6800.html"
